    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Arcane wards protect you from magic for the duration. You have Advantage on saving throws against spells and magical effects, and when you succeed on such a save against an effect that would deal half damage on a success, you take no damage instead.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-MgHAqJ3grlj1u3B8\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The effect marks the wards; apply the Advantage and the damage reduction by hand.</p></section>",
